{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows加载过期或吊销驱动。对应需求：权限提升。官方：Expired or Revoked Driver Loaded。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.library-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows加载过期或吊销驱动","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/previous-versions/windows/hardware/design/dn653559(v=vs.85)?redirectedfrom=MSDN"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"d12bac54-ab2a-4159-933f-d7bcefa7b61d","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 权限提升","来源: 默认","对应需求: 权限提升"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"driver where host.os.type == \"windows\" and process.pid == 4 and\n  dll.code_signature.status : (\"errorExpired\", \"errorRevoked\")\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows加载过期或吊销驱动\n\n### 为何重要\n获取更高权限\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1068","name":"Exploitation for Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1068/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0004","name":"Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0004/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1036","name":"Masquerading","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1036/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1036.001","name":"Invalid Code Signature","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1036/001/"}]},{"id":"T1553","name":"Subvert Trust Controls","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1553/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1553.002","name":"Code Signing","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1553/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的